    "caveats": [
      "1.5 Pa is above the HUVEC microvascular shear range (0.1–1.0 Pa); confirm the endothelial line tolerates arterial-level shear before committing.",
      "Viscosity assumed water-like (1e-3 Pa·s); serum-containing medium is ~0.9–1.1e-3 Pa·s — recalibrate flow if a markedly different medium is used.",
      "The wide-channel shear formula assumes width >> height (400 vs 100 µm is acceptable); for a narrower channel, use the exact rectangular-channel correction.",
